{"4938590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "IN", "steam_appid": 4938590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Recover Unit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maintenance sphere dispatched to reactivate an abandoned orbital station after a catastrophic power failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity has collapsed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life support is failing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fifteen emergency generator units remain dormant across the station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore twelve of them before the station dies forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras/bba437da7383d41aa47af980002e21ce.avif?t=1787408712\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras_big/bba437da7383d41aa47af980002e21ce.avif?t=1787408712 width=1560 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you descend deeper into the facility, the mission begins to contradict itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintenance logs reference personnel that never existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recovered fuel behaves like living tissue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The emergency generators appear to consume far more than energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something beneath the station has been waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not asleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras/30dc745138cacb0df1f489a255f5be26.avif?t=1787408712\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras_big/30dc745138cacb0df1f489a255f5be26.avif?t=1787408712 width=1560 height=676 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interconnected industrial sectors including</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Command Center</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cryogenic Storage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Botanical Laboratory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Biological Containment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Manufacturing Complex</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Maintenance Tunnels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Docking Array</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area hides fragments of a forgotten operation whose true purpose was erased long before your arrival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras/fe5031b9ee949633abd1411d826d57e0.avif?t=1787408712\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras_big/fe5031b9ee949633abd1411d826d57e0.avif?t=1787408712 width=1560 height=708 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you travel,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the less certain it becomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >whether you are restoring the station—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or completing the final stage of an experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras/066e8984d865c7d7d1d8623e05067830.avif?t=1787408712\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras_big/066e8984d865c7d7d1d8623e05067830.avif?t=1787408712 width=1560 height=708 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Explore a massive interconnected space station</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Collect CFL canisters to restore emergency power systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Piece together environmental storytelling and classified documents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Traverse industrial machinery, maintenance shafts and abandoned laboratories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Encounter surreal dreamlike sequences beyond physical reality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Experience a cosmic horror narrative built on implication rather than explanation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Discover multiple layers of meaning hidden beneath routine maintenance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras/d891fb4fe8bf62c3f9b3512c584ca053.avif?t=1787408712\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras_big/d891fb4fe8bf62c3f9b3512c584ca053.avif?t=1787408712 width=1560 height=724 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no heroes here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only things that continue long after their creators disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The station remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is waiting for someone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to finish the work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Recover Unit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maintenance sphere dispatched to reactivate an abandoned orbital station after a catastrophic power failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity has collapsed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life support is failing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fifteen emergency generator units remain dormant across the station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore twelve of them before the station dies forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><i