4938590/extras/fe5031b9ee949633abd1411d826d57e0.avif?t=1787408712\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras_big/fe5031b9ee949633abd1411d826d57e0.avif?t=1787408712 width=1560 height=708 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you travel,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the less certain it becomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >whether you are restoring the station—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or completing the final stage of an experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras/066e8984d865c7d7d1d8623e05067830.avif?t=1787408712\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras_big/066e8984d865c7d7d1d8623e05067830.avif?t=1787408712 width=1560 height=708 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Explore a massive interconnected space station</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Collect CFL canisters to restore emergency power systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Piece together environmental storytelling and classified documents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Traverse industrial machinery, maintenance shafts and abandoned laboratories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Encounter surreal dreamlike sequences beyond physical reality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Experience a cosmic horror narrative built on implication rather than explanation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Discover multiple layers of meaning hidden beneath routine maintenance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras/d891fb4fe8bf62c3f9b3512c584ca053.avif?t=1787408712\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/extras_big/d891fb4fe8bf62c3f9b3512c584ca053.avif?t=1787408712 width=1560 height=724 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no heroes here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only things that continue long after their creators disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The station remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is waiting for someone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to finish the work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "If this message still exists, then we didn’t. Restore the station’s emergency power, explore abandoned laboratories and industrial sectors, solve the failures we left behind, and remember—every generator you restart brings the station closer to life… and something closer to you", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/a85d648fff66490d2c94c83f8c63654d51806279/header.jpg?t=1787408712", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/e5edc2bf6440270c5bcee908d8fce73cd6866b32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787408712", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4938590/e5edc2bf6440270c5bcee908d8fce73cd6866b32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787408712", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10(64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stro